# Persistent profile state
@scenario tutorial_lesson_34
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg room]
[stage clear]
[show ginger beside_code thoughtful]
[set tutorial_source scripts/tutorial/34_profile_state.vns]
[set tutorial_excerpt record]
[set ui.dialogueFacet tutorial_code]
ginger: A regular variable belongs to the current run and its saves. Use a persistent key for a milestone you want to read from a fresh run.
@label lab
> Record a tutorial stamp -> record
> Read the stored stamp -> read_stamp
> Delete this example stamp -> erase
> Back to topics -> return_hub
> Practice exercise -> practice
> Review question -> check
@label record
# region record
[persistent flag tutorial_lab_stamp]
# endregion
ginger: The stamp is saved in this project's profile. Return to the title and start again, then reopen this lesson and read it.
[jump lab]
@label read_stamp
[if persistent.tutorial_lab_stamp]
ginger: The stamp is present.
[else]
ginger: There is no stamp in this profile yet.
[endif]
[jump lab]
@label erase
[persistent clear tutorial_lab_stamp]
ginger: The example key is gone. Try reading the stamp again.
[jump lab]
@label return_hub
[clear ui.dialogueFacet]
[if !tutorial_done_34]
[flag tutorial_done_34]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_7]
[end]

@label practice
[show ginger beside_code thoughtful]
[set ui.dialogueFacet tutorial_code]
ginger: How do you remove just the example stamp?
> Reset the whole profile. -> practice_hint
> Clear the key tutorial_lab_stamp. -> practice_result
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label practice_hint
ginger: Clear the single persistent key and replay Read the stored stamp.
[jump practice]
@label practice_result
ginger: Clear the single persistent key and replay Read the stored stamp.
[clear ui.dialogueFacet]
> Review question -> check
> Try the interactive lab again -> start
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label check
[clear ui.dialogueFacet]
[show ginger guide normal]
ginger: Which store can retain a stamp from a fresh run?
> The persistent profile. -> correct
> Only the scene's local variables. -> retry
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label retry
[show ginger guide confused]
ginger: The persistent store is scoped to the game profile, independent of a save slot.
[jump check]
@label correct
ginger: The persistent store is scoped to the game profile, independent of a save slot.
> Back to topics -> return_hub
> Replay example -> start
